markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Debugging Strategies</h1>
<img src="https://images.code.org/fd0828bb1d9b5cf133d304bff312828a-image-1741370764632.png" alt="Coding bug icon" width="100px" style="border-radius:10px; float:left; margin: 5px 20px 10px 0px;">
<p>Debugging is a critical skill in coding, helping programmers identify and fix errors in their code.</p>
<p>Effective debugging strategies not only improve code accuracy but also build essential problem-solving and logical thinking skills.</p>
<div style="clear:both;"></div>

<h2>Common Debugging Strategies</h2>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">1</span>Validation Testing</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p>Validation testing checks if your program meets expected results by running predefined tests.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 10px;">If a test fails, it means there's a bug to fix.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">2</span>Code Tracing and Print Statements</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p>Code tracing follows the flow of your program to understand what each line is doing.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 10px;">This can be done mentally, on paper, or by adding print statements.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">3</span>AI Assistance</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p>The AI chat is a tool that can help debug your code by analyzing errors, explaining unclear messages, and suggesting fixes.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 10px;">It's especially useful when:</p>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;">• There's <b>no error message</b>, but the program isn't behaving as expected.</p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0;">• <b>The error message is hard to understand.</b></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0;">• You've <b>tried debugging yourself</b> but still aren't sure what's wrong.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">4</span>Error Message Clarifications</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p>Error messages are system-generated feedback that help identify issues in your code.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 10px;">They provide traceback messages that show where an error occurred and the type of issue that needs to be fixed.</p>
</div>
</details>

<h2>Let's try!</h2>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
<p>➡️ Open the <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18Okia2_j-C2QHUhV7_z_a3qgDQvuHdPZP2_hRuq3HUs/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-weight:bold;">Debugging Strategies</a> resource page in a separate tab to guide you in correcting the errors on the next page.</p>
</div>
MARKDOWN
